# rangekit

Tiny integer range helpers for Python 3.12 and later. The package has no
third-party dependencies.

```python
from rangekit import clamp

clamp(15, 0, 10)  # 10
```

{readme_slot}

## Running the tests

Run `python -m pytest` from the repository root; no install step is needed.
The tests import `rangekit` straight from the working tree.

## Layout

- `rangekit/clamp.py`: `clamp(value, low, high)` limits a value to the
  inclusive range `[low, high]`.
- `tests/`: the pytest suite.
